// fpIntrCall as a bare statement, never a sub-expression. Distinct from
// Task 5's `cl_free_globals` (whole-program, at exit) and Task 6's
// statement-temp frees (unnamed intermediates): these three name a real,
// user-declared local by its own EVarRef.
