// IListPush/IListUnshift, chosen by lowListMethod (lower.cla) instead of the
// plain form whenever the pushed value is NON-birth (lowElemIsBirth false --
// a bare local/global/element read, not a fresh literal/concat/slice/call
// result) -- cprint.cla's shared IListPush(Retain)/IListUnshift(Retain)
// printer branch is the only place that reads which of the two names it is;
// everywhere else (arg shape, coercion) is identical to the plain form.
